:: Blood Vessels

<div class="activity-page">

    <h1>Blood Vessels</h1>

    <p class="activity-message">Welcome to the vascular system! Join Ruby on her journey
        and discover how healthy choices help keep your blood flowing.
    </p>

    <h2>🌟 New Activities</h2>

    <div class="activity-card">
        <h3>🩸 The Long Pause</h3>
        <p>Help Ruby choose healthy actions after sitting for too long.</p>
        [[Play Activity →->LongPause]]
    </div>

    <div class="activity-card">
        <h3>🏃 Keep the Blood Moving</h3>
        <p>Discover how movement supports healthy blood circulation.</p>
        <span class="activity-locked">Coming soon!</span>
    </div>

    <h2>✅ Completed Activities</h2>

    <div class="activity-card completed">
        <h3>💧 Hydration Station</h3>
        <p>Learn why drinking enough water is important for your body.</p>
        <span class="completed-label">Completed</span>
    </div>

    <div class="activity-card completed">
        <h3>🥗 Fuel Your Flow</h3>
        <p>Explore how balanced food choices support cardiovascular health.</p>
        <span class="completed-label">Completed</span>
    </div>

    <p class="back-link">
        [[← Return to the body map->HomeScreen]]
    </p>

</div>

:: LongPause
<h1>The Long Pause</h1>

<p>Follow Ruby, a red blood cell traveling through the body's vascular highway. Ruby's person has spent hours sitting at a desk, and the body's movement signals have been quiet.</p>

<p><strong>Ruby:</strong> "It's been a long time since we've moved! Let's help the body get moving again. Can you help me choose what to do?"</p>

<<set $didStretch = false>>
<<set $didWalk = false>>

<h3>Mission: Help Ruby's person!</h3>

<p>Choose TWO healthy actions to support cardiovascular health.</p>

<div class="answer-buttons">

<<button "Stand up and stretch for a little while">>
    <<if !$didStretch>>
        <<set $didStretch = true>>
        <<run Dialog.setup("Correct! Time to Stretch")>>
        <<run Dialog.wiki("Ruby cheers! Taking a movement break helps interrupt long periods of sitting. Even small movement breaks are a great start!")>>
        <<run Dialog.open()>>
        <<replace "#progress">><<include "LongPauseProgress">><</replace>>
    <<else>>
        <<run Dialog.setup("Already Completed")>>
        <<run Dialog.wiki("You've already chosen stretching! Try the other healthy action.")>>
        <<run Dialog.open()>>
    <</if>>
<</button>>

<<button "Take a short walk around the room">>
    <<if !$didWalk>>
        <<set $didWalk = true>>
        <<run Dialog.setup("Correct! Let's Get Moving")>>
        <<run Dialog.wiki("Ruby happily travels along the bloodstream. Walking gets the body moving, and regular physical activity can help manage blood pressure over time.")>>
        <<run Dialog.open()>>
        <<replace "#progress">><<include "LongPauseProgress">><</replace>>
    <<else>>
        <<run Dialog.setup("Already Completed")>>
        <<run Dialog.wiki("You've already chosen walking! Try the other healthy action.")>>
        <<run Dialog.open()>>
    <</if>>
<</button>>

<<button "Keep sitting for several more hours without a break">>
    <<run Dialog.setup("Not Quite!")>>
    <<run Dialog.wiki("Ruby explains: Sitting for long periods without breaks means missing opportunities to move. Try a short movement break instead.")>>
    <<run Dialog.open()>>
<</button>>

<<button "Open a bag of high-sodium chips">>
    <<run Dialog.setup("Not Quite!")>>
    <<run Dialog.wiki("Ruby explains: Regularly eating too much sodium can make blood pressure harder to manage. Let's make choices that support cardiovascular health!")>>
    <<run Dialog.open()>>
<</button>>

</div>

<hr>

<div id="progress">
    <<include "LongPauseProgress">>
</div>


:: LongPauseProgress

<p><strong>Healthy choices:</strong>
<<if $didStretch && !$didWalk>>1<</if>><<if $didStretch and $didWalk>> 2 <</if>><<if $didWalk && !$didStretch>>1<</if>> / 2</p>

<<if $didStretch and $didWalk>>
    <h3>Both choices completed!</h3>
    <p>Ruby is ready to continue the journey.</p>
    [[Continue to the lesson->LongPauseLesson]]
<<else>>
    <p>Choose both healthy actions to unlock the next lesson.</p>
<</if>>


:: LongPauseLesson
<h1>Lesson Learned!</h1>

<p>Ruby travels onward through the bloodstream.</p>

<p><strong>Ruby:</strong> "You did it! Small choices can make a difference when we practice them regularly."</p>

<p><strong>Remember:</strong> Sitting for long periods can be interrupted with basic movement breaks. Regular physical activity and a balanced, lower-sodium eating pattern can help manage blood pressure over time.</p>

[[Return to the body map->HomeScreen]]


